{"game": "aliens-fireteam-elite", "language": "english", "appid": 1549970, "month": "2026-01", "window": 4, "start_date": 1769212800, "end_date": 1769903999, "month_true_total": 85, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-04 02:26:01 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "217267055", "author": {"steamid": "76561198078810401", "personaname": "Doomguy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/the_doomguy/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 65, "playtime_forever": 3127, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2243, "last_played": 1770066473, "avatar": "3f9f12980a460526d00be6afd179986611c4dc9a"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game is good, albeit short and lacking content. But that's not the reason why I can't recommend it. The reason is nobody plays it and crossplay doesn't help. Playing with bots sucks cause you can't set them in any way, can't choose their classes, nothing. Besides you can't even join other people's games until you've finished the campaign. You can only open your game and hope some will join. Wanna know how many times it happened to me? Two times only. Oh btw, games cannot be joined once started. So most times you're stuck with terrible bots trying to finish the damn campaign to finally unlock the quickplay option and be able to join other games, and even then you'll spend most time searching for matches without finding anything. Oh, and there's absolutely no way to communicate with other players in game, there's no text nor voice chat. So you might very well join games with just 1 player who won't press Ready for like 10 minutes and there's no way to talk to him. Terrible experience.", "timestamp_created": 1769878480, "timestamp_updated": 1769878480, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "217256403", "author": {"steamid": "76561198058871071", "personaname": "Riko", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198058871071/", "num_games_owned": 613, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 3117, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3117, "last_played": 1769869460, "avatar": "2ea42fc8df9aa58ff71ba93a929f623d61d884cf"}, "language": "english", "review": "Decent game but started to have connection issues as of late. Sometimes it works, sometimes it doesn't.\nPlaying with friends became impossible for me and playing solo with bots that shoot you more than they shoot at enemies is a torture. \nSince the devs moved on I don't have much faith in this game but I would like to be surpised.\nIt's a fun game if you can find someone to play with and are able to connect to them but otherwise look for something else.", "timestamp_created": 1769870175, "timestamp_updated": 1775494599, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 27, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.741665661334991455", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 32, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "217187003", "author": {"steamid": "76561199203842751", "personaname": "CosmicPlague", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199203842751/", "num_games_owned": 165, "num_reviews": 102, "playtime_forever": 99, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 99, "last_played": 1769800232, "avatar": "7995e464e0732f1238e09d84032e8a0ce3ba3b52"}, "language": "english", "review": "Aliens", "timestamp_created": 1769800254, "timestamp_updated": 1769800254, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "co